I am running software RAID1 just fine on my PC164LX, though with IDE =20
drives.  I just upgraded to 2.4.23 last week, no problems.

md: autorun ...
md: considering hdc3 ...
md:  adding hdc3 ...
md:  adding hda3 ...
md: created md1
md: bind<hda3,1>
