bug only recently fixed in 3.x that would cause software RAID on Alpha =20
to fail, but IIRC the result was an oops, not the symptom you show.  =20
But just to make sure, you might try the version I used: Version: =20
1:3.3.2-4 (from unstable).

One other thought:
> md: device name has changed from sdc1 to sdb1 since last import!

Is it possible the drives are sometimes being added in reverse order?  =20
Or did you 'dd' one to the other to start out?

-Doug

